cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, cite the repository."
title: "graph_pro: Arma 3 rendering and CPU research notes"
abstract: >-
  A research repository for Arma 3 (Real Virtuality 4, D3D11): a d3d11 proxy
  that replaces post-process shaders by exact size/CRC fingerprints and injects
  material constants, an offline A/B measurement pipeline, and a separate
  CPU-attribution toolkit for headless servers and clients. The main output is
  the evidence: which hooks work, which are structurally impossible, and which
  optimisations turned out to be no-ops or regressions.
authors:
